flowchart LR
  Claim[One reserved timber packet] --> Ready[Two living free rear workers at registered source grip stations]
  Ready --> Begin[Ledger creates one JointCarry holder / transfers one stock portion atomically]
  Begin --> Move[Activity commits both worker endpoints and one payload endpoint before events]
  Move --> Pending[Duty changes pending / independent carries and station entry refused]
  Pending --> Finish[Both actual destination stations / one warehouse promise]
  Finish --> Deposit[One exact deposit / clear both commitments / safe duty handoff]
  Move -->|member casualty| Ground[One recoverable ground stock at actual payload position]
  View[Presenter reads shared operation / never duplicates cargo] -.-> Move
